# Environment variables - NEVER commit this
.env

# Virtual environment
venv/
env/

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Django
*.log
db.sqlite3

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```

---

The most important one is `.env` — it contains your **MongoDB Atlas password** and **Gmail App Password**. If you push that to GitHub, anyone can access your database and email. 🚨

Also make sure your **React project** `.gitignore` (in the root folder) already has:
```
node_modules/
.env
.env.local